# Game / level scene

- Orchestration: `game.gd` resolves level → live `LevelData`
- States: `GameManager` FSM (`Playing` / `Completing` / `Victory`)
- Features: `letter_tile`, `word_slot`, `animal` (photo+blur), `celebration`
- No photo yet → `LevelData.emoji` fades in during the reveal (`AnimalView.placeholder_label`)
- Words up to 12 letters: `game.gd` fits one row via `_fit_cell_size` → `set_cell_size()` on slots/tiles (64–100 px)
- After a win the ▶ button (and 🏠) return to the level's zone: `ev_return_to_menu({zone_id, arrived_level_id})`; `arrived_level_id` only on a first win → the zone screen plays the arrival
- **Letters only** of the target word; scatter randomly (no distractors)
- Grab → straighten + phoneme; magnet snap; miss → fly-up repel
- Tap filled slot → phoneme; complete → speak word + unblur photo
- Idle hint (`inactivity_sec`): slot glows, tile pulses, `HandHint` drags a ghost `LetterTile` onto the slot; any grab stops it
- `LevelData.tutorial`: hint after `tutorial_inactivity_sec`, magnet `tutorial_magnet_radius`, always 3 stars, 👆 taps ▶ after the win
- Exit: `root_events.ev_return_to_menu` (always back to the zone)

## Voice (letter sounds + words)

- Current clips are a TEMPORARY placeholder (consonant sounds are inaccurate: TTS reads names / adds vowels). Final plan: record a human voice for all letters (+ words) at the end of development, once the word list is final
- Letters are voiced by SOUND (phonics: "м", not "эм"); `Ъ`/`Ь` say their names
- Clips: `assets/audio/voice/{letters,words}/*.ogg` → `VoiceBank` (`src/features/sfx/voice_bank.tres`) on `SfxController`
- Generated by `tools/generate_voice.py` (edge-tts, ru-RU-SvetlanaNeural; venv in `tools/.venv`). Kids game: slow, warm, never cut clips abruptly; words read from `src/levels/*.tres` — rerun after adding a level
- Mascot phrases: `VoiceBank.phrases` (`PHRASES` in the script); album facts: `VoiceBank.facts[animal_id]` (`assets/audio/voice/facts/`, from `LevelData.fact`); `--missing` regenerates only absent clips. Missing clip → `ToneSynth` fallback. Never hand-edit `voice_bank.tres`; tweak `LETTER_TEXT`/`WORD_STRESS` in the script
- Triggers: grab, snap, tap placed letter → `ev_play_phoneme`; completion → letters paced by `SfxController.get_phoneme_length` → `ev_play_word`
